// Overlap block and its derivative with respect to the position of atom i (= d/d vec, since vec = R_i - R_j).
// Moving the centre of a Cartesian Gaussian x^l exp(-a x^2) by dA_x changes it by 2a x^(l+1) e^.. - l x^(l-1) e^..,
